  "resolution_html": "<p>To obtain LIST OWNER information, request the List Owner's Manual as follows:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Address your mail message to <a href=\"mailto:listserv@yorku.ca\">listserv@yorku.ca</a></li>\n<li>In the body of your email message issue the command:<strong>info owner</strong></li>\n<li>LISTSERV will reply with the List Owner's Manual</li>\n</ol>\n<p>You can also obtain the owner's manual in PDF format by clicking<br/><a href=\"http://www.lsoft.com/resources/manuals.asp\">http://www.lsoft.com/resources/manuals.asp</a></p>",
